            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Intel, Fedex, Cardlytics, Brera, : Trending Stocks",
            "description": "<p>Intel (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/INTC\">INTC</a>) skyrocketed yesterday, closing more than 22% higher after Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>) announced its $5 billion investment in the company, as part of a push to produce more AI hardware and products in the US. Fedex (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/FDX\">FDX</a>) is in focus after reporting results late yesterday that beat analysts\u2019 expectations despite tariff headwinds, and we take a look at a tiny company that has become the market\u2019s latest rocket ship: Brera Holdings (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BREA\">BREA</a>). Plus, Cardlytics (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CDLX\">CDLX</a>) soars on hopes that it will benefit from American Express' (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AXP\">AXP</a>) new Platinum cards. For more live coverage of markets watch the full episode of<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cLr6hc2-oMY&list=PLx28zU8ctIRqTE7Y4uXTY-S2oHlwDsL5c\"> Market Sunrise</a> and head to<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/\"> Yahoo Finance</a>.</p>",
